==English==
[[File:Holzzahnstocher.jpg|thumb|Photograph of a container full of wooden '''toothpicks'''.]]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|tooth|pick}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/tuːθ.pɪk/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-toothpick.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q41331}}A small, usually [[wooden]], [[stick]], often [[pointed]] at both ends, for removing [[food]] [[residue]] from between the [[tooth|teeth]].
# {{lb|en|slang|derogatory}} A very [[thin]] [[individual]].
# {{lb|en|slang|derogatory}} A [[small]] or [[slender]] [[penis]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|dentiscalp}}, {{l|en|picktooth}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

